<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>6.1.6: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01566</md:content-id>
    <md:title>6.1.6: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>eea65483-74d1-4081-a115-fe47cfba6bd9</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para><emphasis><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></emphasis></para>
<para>For questions 1 – 5, simplify each expression completely. </para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(14ab^2-8ab^2\) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(6ab^2\)</item>
  <item> \(22ab^2\)</item>
  <item>\(14ab^2\)</item>
  <item>\(8ab^2\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(6ab^2\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((8k^2-3k+14)+(8k+17)  \)  </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((8k^2+5k+31)\) </para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((7b^2-2b-12)-(4b^2+9b-7) \)  </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(11b^2+7b-19\)</item>
  <item>\(3b^2+7b-19\)</item>
  <item>\(3b^2-11b-5\)</item>
  <item>\(11b^2-11b-5\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(3b^2-11b-5\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( (7mn^3-2m^2n-12mn)-(3mn^3-4mn) \)  </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(10mn^3-2m^2n-16mn\)</item>
  <item>\(4mn^3-2m^2n-8mn\) </item>
  <item>\(4mn^3-2m^2n-16mn\)</item>
  <item>\(4mn^3-10m^2n\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(4mn^3-2m^2n-8mn\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( (r^3-r^2s)-2(rs^2+s^3)+(r^2s+2rs^2) \)  </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(r^3+2s^3\)</item>
  <item>\(r^3-rs^2-2s^3\)</item>
  <item>\(r^3-2s^3\)</item>
  <item> \(r^3+rs^2-2s^3\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(r^3-2s^3\)</para>
<para>Use the following polynomial functions to answer 6 - 10.</para>
<para>\(p(x) = 12x^2+3x-4\)
  \(d(x) = 3x^2-11x-6\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( p(4) =\) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(−2\) </item>
  <item>\(200\) </item>
  <item>\(192\) </item>
  <item>\(48\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(200\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(d(−3) \) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(95\) </item>
  <item>\(113\) </item>
  <item>\(54\) </item>
  <item>\(−12\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(54\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(p(x) + d(x) \) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(15x^2+8x+10\)</item>
  <item>\(-9x^2-14x-2\)</item>
  <item>\(9x^2+14x+2\)</item>
  <item>\(15x^2-8x-10\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(15x^2-8x-10\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(p(x) − d(x) \) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(15x^2+8x+10\)</item>
  <item>\(15x^2-8x-10\)</item>
  <item>\(9x^2+14x+2\)</item>
  <item>\(15x^2-8x-10\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(9x^2+14x+2\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( p(5) − d(−6) \) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(143\) </item>
  <item>\(311\) </item>
  <item>\(168\) </item>
  <item>\(479\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(143\)</para>
</section>
</content>
